        "description": "Luis Rocha discovered that AFFLIB incorrectly handled certain input files.   If a user or automated system were tricked into processing a specially crafted AFF image file, a remote attacker could possibly use this issue  to cause a denial of service via application crash. (CVE-2018-8050)",
